1-25/491823994_1935798273623180_9023901920183873423_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a9Uu2Jdl5jgQ7kNvwGJCS0P&_nc_oc=AdoMDHWtg7U3llwb9Cln5aEUo8kL-MaA0M8JKhfgAOPxGtdghbP-kcUDavKmDxNiiP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9QBLVYfLnW0aKzmhUNHy17Ypsd6SN9HPd3KYcB6e-7A&oe=6B01E86B"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1412724262945032", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499318074_1412724266278365_4253179642551190540_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0kyJ4HzOw-IQ7kNvwGxPzhD&_nc_oc=Adpqpah0J2pCphjB5u6BEHABDwbOlOK4WxhFJX-WHpSmQtLdyyKndp-bhTyGYi63i_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTaG1viWh_dM61xvnwq3c2b2khvYAcneBAfqdip3j0I1g&oe=6B01BE8E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MR Drone Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Master drone flying in minutes\u2014no crashes, no consequences.\nMR Drone Simulator: Learn to Fly is a beginner-friendly mixed reality simulator built for Meta Quest. It blends your real-world surroundings with immersive training missions, teaching you how to fly a virtual drone safely and confidently.\nWhether you're a new drone owner, a student, or just curious about drone tech, this is the perfect starting point.\n Key Features:\nMixed Reality Training: Fly a virtual drone in your own space using passthrough\n\n\nStep-by-Step Lessons: Start with takeoff, hovering, and safe landings\n\n\nRealistic Controls: Master pitch, roll, yaw, and throttle with intuitive inputs\n\n\nImmersive Practice Environments: Overlay your room with training zones, targets, and obstacles\n\n\nProgress Tracking: Earn badges and advance through beginner levels\n\n\nThis is your risk-free, crash-proof launchpad to the skies.\n", "short_description": "Learn drone flying basics with mixed reality training in your real space.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_p